"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-117-xiangru:p001","quote":"從遊說之士齊人鄒陽、淮陰枚乘、吳莊忌夫子之徒","references":[{"title":"《漢書》卷五十七上·顏師古注","url":"https://github.com/kanripo/KR2a0007/blob/683113d4baf6febecaf2ccb7913df87c4d68d454/KR2a0007_057.txt#L21-L23","raw_quote":"是時梁孝王來朝從游説之士齊人鄒陽淮隂枚乗吳¶\n嚴忌夫子之徒(師古曰嚴忌本姓莊當時尊尚號曰/夫子史家避漢明帝諱故遂為嚴耳)相¶\n如見而説之(師古曰説/讀曰悦)因病免客游梁得與諸侯游士¶","quote":"嚴忌本姓莊","scope":"ancient_commentary_name_and_avoidance","image_verified":false,"source_commit":"683113d4baf6febecaf2ccb7913df87c4d68d454","source_blob_sha":"44cd0a168123204ab8369c8382018dbaaa846a86","response_sha256":"5bf61d952a80006912de5185a7859b7defe4818c78c1702401789b47f0ecf064","response_extent":{"first_line":1,"last_line":95,"partial_file":true}}],"note":"顏師古明言本姓莊、夫子為尊號，暫以其有具體尊尚說明為顯示預設；徐廣名忌字夫子另列未採納成分說，不稱注家一致。嚴忌為漢書避諱書寫，不當本人改名或普遍改姓史實。","status":"editorial_provisional","human_reviewed":false,"component_alternatives":[{"components":{"surname":null,"ming":"忌","zi":"夫子"},"status":"source_claim_not_selected","reference":{"title":"《史記集解》卷一百十七·徐廣注","url":"https://github.com/kanripo/KR2a0002/blob/73c4d2ba067d99a6de924ac952fd6921a958c7e7/KR2a0002_117.txt#L17-L19","raw_quote":"景帝不好辭賦是時梁孝王來朝從游說之士齊人鄒¶\n陽淮隂枚乘呉莊忌夫子之徒(徐廣曰名/忌字夫子)相如見而說¶\n之因病免客遊梁梁孝王令與諸生同舍相如得與諸¶","quote":"名忌字夫子","quote_normalization":"僅移除雙行注斜線及換行；未改文字","scope":"ancient_commentary_component_alternative","image_verified":false,"source_commit":"73c4d2ba067d99a6de924ac952fd6921a958c7e7","source_blob_sha":"ccded97eee2542083010172d857d6251a09a126c","response_sha256":"c1ac3c7fa1eec92edc267bd6fd0316450dac4010f46598e5683d8b416632e7ff","response_extent":{"first_line":1,"last_line":100,"partial_file":true}},"source_terms":{"ming":"名忌","zi":"字夫子"},"rationale":"徐廣作字夫子，與顏師古當時尊尚號曰夫子之解分存；此項不作預設。"}],"work_id":"w-shiji","book_id":"b-shiji-117","source_id":"s-shiji117-xiangru"}],"mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-083-luzou:m015-0016","start":16,"end":20,"surface":"莊忌夫子","kind":"person","person_id":"g8d_9kf_uqg","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-083-luzou:p015","chapter_id":"c-shiji-083-luzou"},{"id":"c-shiji-117-xiangru:m001-0107","start":107,"end":109,"surface":"莊忌","kind":"person","person_id":"g8d_9kf_uqg","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-117-xiangru:p001","chapter_id":"c-shiji-117-xiangru"}],"relations":[],"title_holdings":[],"address_assertions":[{"id":"pa-shiji117-004","person_id":"g8d_9kf_uqg","relation":"biographical_origin","place":{"source_name":"吳","place_id":null,"modern_identification":null},"status":"source_attested","date_expression":null,"evidence":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-117-xiangru","source_id":"s-shiji117-xiangru","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-117-xiangru:p001","quote":"司馬相如者，蜀郡成都人也，字長卿。少時好讀書，學擊劍，故其親名之曰犬子。相如既學，慕藺相如之為人，更名相如。以貲為郎，事孝景帝，為武騎常侍，非其好也。會景帝不好辭賦，是時梁孝王來朝，從遊說之士齊人鄒陽、淮陰枚乘、吳莊忌夫子之徒，相如見而說之，因病免，客游梁。梁孝王令與諸生同舍，相如得與諸生游士居數歲，乃著子虛之賦。"}],"source_term":"吳莊忌","interpretation_note":"來源人地稱謂，保留原字與地名範圍；不推出生地或現代轄區。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","human_reviewed":false}],"table_occurrences":[],"date_normalizations":[],"birth_order_constraints":[],"preferred_birth_order_constraints":[],"identity_decisions":[{"id":"d-shiji083-035","person_id":"g8d_9kf_uqg","scope":"same_chapter","chapter_ids":["c-shiji-083-luzou"],"status":"contextual_provisional","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","rationale":"按獄中上書引古與梁廷敘事分層，保留原稱。枚生及衛先生未以記憶補姓名；王奢不改作趙奢。燕丹與丹限荊軻句群，臣與大王限鄒陽對梁孝王的上書。","surfaces":["莊忌夫子"],"evidence":[{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-083-luzou:p015","quote":"鄒陽者，齊人也。游於梁，與故吳人莊忌夫子、淮陰枚生之徒交。上書而介於羊勝、公孫詭之閒。勝等嫉鄒陽，惡之梁孝王。孝王怒，下之吏，將欲殺之。鄒陽客游，以讒見禽，恐死而負累，乃從獄中上書曰："}]}],"equivalence_decisions":[{"id":"eq-shiji117-opening-zhuangji","person_ids":["g8d_9kf_uqg"],"canonical_person_id":"g8d_9kf_uqg","scope":"cross_chapter","chapter_ids":["c-shiji-117-xiangru","c-shiji-083-luzou"],"status":"contextual_provisional","confidence_level":"high","evidence":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-117-xiangru","source_id":"s-shiji117-xiangru","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-117-xiangru:p001","quote":"司馬相如者，蜀郡成都人也，字長卿。少時好讀書，學擊劍，故其親名之曰犬子。相如既學，慕藺相如之為人，更名相如。以貲為郎，事孝景帝，為武騎常侍，非其好也。會景帝不好辭賦，是時梁孝王來朝，從遊說之士齊人鄒陽、淮陰枚乘、吳莊忌夫子之徒，相如見而說之，因病免，客游梁。梁孝王令與諸生同舍，相如得與諸生游士居數歲，乃著子虛之賦。","mention_ids":["c-shiji-117-xiangru:m001-0107"]},{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-083-luzou","source_id":"s-shiji-083-luzou","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-083-luzou:p015","quote":"鄒陽者，齊人也。游於梁，與故吳人莊忌夫子、淮陰枚生之徒交。上書而介於羊勝、公孫詭之閒。勝等嫉鄒陽，惡之梁孝王。孝王怒，下之吏，將欲殺之。鄒陽客游，以讒見禽，恐死而負累，乃從獄中上書曰：","mention_ids":["c-shiji-083-luzou:m015-0016"]}],"rationale":"吳人莊忌夫子與鄒陽及淮陰枚生同客梁的平行敘事，與本篇吳莊忌夫子同指；夫子是尊稱，不改作名。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","human_reviewed":false,"model":null,"identity_materialized":true}],"passages":[{"id":"c-shiji-083-luzou:p015","text":"鄒陽者，齊人也。游於梁，與故吳人莊忌夫子、淮陰枚生之徒交。上書而介於羊勝、公孫詭之閒。勝等嫉鄒陽，惡之梁孝王。孝王怒，下之吏，將欲殺之。鄒陽客游，以讒見禽，恐死而負累，乃從獄中上書曰：","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-083-luzou:m015-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"鄒陽","kind":"person","person_id":"06n_ttw_xgt","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-083-luzou:m015-0016","start":16,"end":20,"surface":"莊忌夫子","kind":"person","person_id":"g8d_9kf_uqg","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-083-luzou:m015-0023","start":23,"end":25,"surface":"枚生","kind":"person","person_id":"e1m_xt0_8w7","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-083-luzou:m015-0025","start":25,"end":27,"surface":"之徒","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、泛稱或譬喻保留；燕尾生不直接當作另一具名人物。"},{"id":"c-shiji-083-luzou:m015-0034","start":34,"end":36,"surface":"羊勝","kind":"person","person_id":"fo7_9ev_cht","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-083-luzou:m015-0037","start":37,"end":40,"surface":"公孫詭","kind":"person","person_id":"2bl_b4d_kfg","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-083-luzou:m015-0043","start":43,"end":44,"surface":"勝","kind":"person","person_id":"fo7_9ev_cht","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-083-luzou:m015-0046","start":46,"end":48,"surface":"鄒陽","kind":"person","person_id":"06n_ttw_xgt","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-083-luzou:m015-0051","start":